the game continued as per the text.}) 12. g4 Qe5 13. Nxe6 fxe6 14. Bg5 h6 15.
Nxc5 Qxc5 16. fxg7 hxg5 17. gxh8=Q Rxh8 18. Rxe6 Rf8 19. Qe2 Kd7 20. Re4 d3 21.
